WEBVTT

00:22:58.788 --> 00:23:04.163
And seven years later, the signal I got in
that group meeting is that I was sad,

00:23:04.163 --> 00:23:08.121
angry and upset. And being aware
of this helped me decide that

00:23:08.121 --> 00:23:11.829
the right thing to do at that moment
was to share these emotions with my

00:23:11.829 --> 00:23:17.288
colleagues. In the past, I would have
kept the steam inside building up,

00:23:17.663 --> 00:23:19.788
fearing I might offend if I spoke up.

00:23:20.454 --> 00:23:23.871
But this time I spoke up through tears,

00:23:24.329 --> 00:23:27.413
which allowed us to push through
a very difficult conversation.

00:23:27.996 --> 00:23:31.038
It also showed us that when we're in
touch with our emotions at work